[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_MANDATE]
Mandate of Shadows

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_MANDATE_desc]
§g“How can they hear without some umbrums ‘preaching’ them?”§!\nThe crystal ponies listened to Sombra’s mandate. Every word was right. Every word was good. Every word was true.\nAnd so, the shadow and mandate of the great emperor transformed everypony who listened. The great emperor hadn’t lied to them. The empire changed.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_MANDATE]
暗影的旨意

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_MANDATE_desc]
§g“若非影魔‘传教’，他们怎么能听到？”§!\n水晶小马们聆听了森布拉的旨意。字字正确，字字珠玑，字字真实。\n于是，伟大皇帝的影子和旨意改变了每一个听从的小马。伟大皇帝并没有欺骗他们。帝国改变了。

